<title>DUBAI: Abu Dhabi Shipbuilding in maiden results.</title>
<headline>Abu Dhabi Shipbuilding in maiden results.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>18 months to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (In millions of UAE dirhams, rounded)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   3.51</p>
<p>    Income from contracts	   61.32</p>
<p>    Net operating income	    18.47</p>
<p>    Interest earned		    4.29</p>
<p>Full name: Abu Dhabi Shipbuilding Co</p>
<p>Note: The company was formed in 1994 as a joint venture between the government of Abu Dhabi and Newport News Shipbuilding of the United States.</p>
</text>
